v 1.2.7
d DATADOC: Create a nicely formatted MS Word DOCX codebook for data documentation
d
d Export metadata and summary statistics from the current Stata data frame 
d to a DOCX file codebook, aesthetically inspired by the formatting of codebooks  
d distributed by ICPSR. Includes many customizable codebook elements.
d
d The accompanying Excel spreadsheet template can be used to quickly store 
d variable metadata in Stata using variable characteristics datadoc can access 
d and export. The spreadsheet will install with datadoc as an ancillary file 
d located in the same ado PLUS directory as datadoc.
d 
d Requires: Stata 19+ 
d 
d Author: Kenneth Elpus
d Support: provided as is with no support offered
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261013
d
f datadoc.ado
f datadoc.sthlp
F datadoc_metadata_prep.xltx